Yes, so I should specify a saturated model at the second level.

It would look something like this

"level: 1

      F1 =~ NA*y1 + y2 + y3
      F2 =~ NA*y4 + y5
      F1 ~~ 1*F1
      F2 ~~ 1*F2
      F1 ~~ F2
      M1 ~ a*F1 + c*F2
      DV ~ b*F1 + d*F2 + e*M1

level: 2
      M1 ~~ M1 + DV
      DV ~~ DV"

Thank you for your help.

