I see two issues.

1. lavaan WARNING: some observed variances are (at least) a factor 1000 times larger than others; use variable(fit) to investigate.

As it says, your variances are very different, this causes problems. Multiply  / divide your variable by a constant to make their variances more equa..

2. Most of the other errors.

Your sample is (much) too small. Recommendations about minimum sample sizes vary, but you want at least 100.

Jeremy

