Date: Thu, 21 Mar 2019 10:15:13 +0000
Subject: Re: Path analysis: Discrepancy between bootstrapped CI and p-value
Message-ID: <uO_E7HDLAcI.JCk09t0vCwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <uO_E7HDLAcI.C0fGpBYTCQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
